sherpa-onnx-streaming-zipformer-en-2023-06-21: k2-fsa's streaming Zipformer
transducer trained with icefall on LibriSpeech and GigaSpeech, released by
k2-fsa under the Apache License 2.0
(https://huggingface.co/csukuangfj/sherpa-onnx-streaming-zipformer-en-2023-06-21).
